Scourge' Room~
You have entered Scourge's private room.  It is rather dark, those of 
good alignment may find it sinister and feel uncomfortable...those who walk
the path of evil are right at home.  There is a roaring fire in the fireplace,
yet the room feels chilly.  There are some plants in the window, but they 
appear to be dead.  Scourge is sitting in a black and red chair, he grins 
at you evilly.
~
